,["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in July to August 2025 and 44% in November to December 2025. August to September is the driest pair at 6.61 inches of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
